{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Fix committed as 1b026ee5627 (branch fix-reviewbot-drain-flake); make verify running with CI's extras (reviewbot, ui, grounding-terraform) installed so the review-bot tests execute rather than skip. Evidence: the rewritten drain test fails with the autouse 1 s window (5 lookups x 0.3 s) and passes with its own 60 s window; tests/unit/test_review_bot.py + the stale-vote and retrigger modules passed 5 of 5 runs under -n 4 (186 tests each), and the module's output no longer contains 'Network access is forbidden' or 'I/O operation on closed file'. Added 2 direct tests of the real app._current_revision (fail-open on GerritError, and reads the current patch set), marked review_bot_real_lookup so the autouse stub skips them."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793308696658845001,"uuid":"29ed1fba-3f54-4b34-bb9d-ada034334f6a"}